                "text": "### Booking Confirmation Required\n\nWould you like me to book the following?\n*   **Hotel**: Devil's Lake Resort (Check-in: 2026-09-10, Check-out: 2026-09-11)\n\nPlease reply 'yes' to proceed, or 'no' to cancel."
              }
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "invocation_id": "inv-3",
